  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "What do we know about the future?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5D371F4D5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Difficult question, simple answer: nothing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "625CD769C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "We cannot predict the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F5120A8955",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 165,
        "endOffset": 201,
        "text": "breaks the chains of common thinking",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8E3E3B17A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 101,
        "endOffset": 164,
        "text": "which is inspiring, and this is the most important reason which",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "788B4810FC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "There are a lot of people who created their own vision about the future, for instance, this vision here from the early 20th century.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B3C6B16375",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "It says here that this is the ocean plane of the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F74C2DF11B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "It takes only one and a half days to cross the Atlantic Ocean.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FF1E583343",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "Today, we know that this future vision didn't come true.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E864836C73",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 73,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "quite huge",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "030DD4A995",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 193,
        "text": "So this is our largest airplane which we have, the Airbus A380, and it's quite huge, so a lot of people fit in there and it's technically completely different than the vision I've shown to you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CD73797FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "I'm working in a team with Airbus, and we have created our vision about a more sustainable future of aviation.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "82DFC02369",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "So sustainability is quite important for us, which should incorporate social but as well as environmental and economic values.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0397C6243D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 53,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "mimics the design of bone, or a skeleton",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04ED3F58A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 101,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "occurs in nature",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90BDE9E9C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "So that's why it looks maybe a little bit weird, especially to the people who deal with structures in general.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68C700E888",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "But at least it's just a kind of artwork to explore our ideas about a different future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "73E78AC655",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "What are the main customers of the future?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F26BA0D589",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "we have the old, we have the young, we have the uprising power of women",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9DD9971799",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "So, we have the old, we have the young, we have the uprising power of women, and there's one mega-trend which affects all of us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6327F81F67",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "These are the future anthropometrics.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E830775E0A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "So our children are getting larger, but at the same time we are growing into different directions.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC00824CFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "So what we need is space inside the aircraft, inside a very dense area.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0685054437",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "These people have different needs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D5F216F5F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "So we see a clear need of active health promotion, especially in the case of the old people.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A839C95303",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "We want to be treated as individuals.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "15566E66FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 208,
        "text": "We like to be productive throughout the entire travel chain, and what we are doing in the future is we want to use the latest man-machine interface, and we want to integrate this and show this in one product.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D23BCF1570",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "So we combined these needs with technology’s themes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "862407884A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 42,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "how can we create more light?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E6816E59E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "So for instance, we are asking ourselves, how can we create more light?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "902096E697",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "How can we bring more natural light into the airplane?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FCD4D8A2B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "So this airplane has no windows anymore, for example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE845E3E1B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "What about the data and communication software which we need in the future?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5271896AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "the airplane of the future will get its own consciousness",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA491ACB1C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "My belief is that the airplane of the future will get its own consciousness.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FF7A00D74F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "It will be more like a living organism than just a collection of very complex technology.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D9B0FC071",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "It will be more like a living organism than just a collection of very complex technology.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BCE90B35B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "This will be very different in the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "34B1A8A233",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "It will communicate directly with the passenger in its environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CF359EE035",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "And then we are talking also about materials, synthetic biology, for example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62B5F63C64",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "more and more new materials",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3944AB9CB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 166,
        "text": "And my belief is that we will get more and more new materials which we can put into structure later on, because structure is one of the key issues in aircraft design.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "36DEA31395",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "So let's compare the old world with the new world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "340AF67E4B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "I just want to show you here what we are doing today.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "409CE59144",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "So this is a bracket of an A380 crew rest compartment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4B21BE1A0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "It takes a lot of weight, and it follows the classical design rules.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "03F2F93604",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "This here is an equal bracket for the same purpose.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6C7E20CE00",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "It follows the design of bone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C590F1ED5B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "The design process is completely different.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1506B83876",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "At the one hand, we have 1.2 kilos, and at the other hand 0.6 kilos.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68BB4FA93D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 194,
        "text": "reduce the weight, which is the biggest issue in aircraft design, because it's directly linked to greenhouse gas emissions",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8A40FB4595",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "So this technology, 3D printing, and new design rules really help us to",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2AC931865F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Push this idea a little bit forward.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "564B8F86AC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "So how does nature build its components and structures?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C8C0C4F4AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "So nature is very clever.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FC20F1B76A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "It puts all the information into these small building blocks",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "871AC069EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "And nature builds large skeletons out of it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B9C7C996FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 66,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "as I said",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7265D020B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 94,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "we train our muscles, we train our skeleton",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F17978E3BD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "And the same approach can be applied to technology as well.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "972477A85E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 75,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "rivet-less skeleton",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F40075F95D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "you can show it here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "635533C707",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 70,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "they are embedded inside a matrix of plastic",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2848AEACD0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "And you've got trillions of them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "226F630622",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "align them to wood",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14C061DD78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "And now we take this material, combine this with a top-down approach, and build bigger and bigger components.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4D508F39F2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "So how might the airplane of the future look?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9EC4C0D7A6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 38,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "adapt to the shape of the future passenger",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "951370870B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "you can play virtual golf",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8FBF649775",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "bionic structure",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CBE9325061",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 159,
        "text": "And finally, this bionic structure, which is covered by a transparent biopolymer membrane, will really change radically how we look at aircrafts in the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60518B6BEC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "if we can imagine it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "280EF45E4F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "So as Jason Silva said, if we can imagine it, why not make it so?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA983402A9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "See you in the future.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "739A9A5E17",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B9B1871B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
